    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Bi</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;will get dissociated as:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Bi</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8652;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Bi</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p>Here,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mn>108</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>08</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>73</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>108</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac>